					<description><![CDATA[<p>First teased with “PAY ME” in July, the six-track project pairs Aibrid’s buoyant production with Kobilou’s loose, melodic delivery.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://thenativemag.com/kobilou-and-airbrid-are-extending-their-winning-streak-with-dbaddet-in-thi-bitch/">Kobilou And Aibrid Are Extending Their Winning Streak With ‘D’BADDE$T IN THI$ BITCH</a> appeared first on <a href="https://thenativemag.com">The NATIVE</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Kobilou has teamed up with Aibrid for a new project titled </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">‘D’BADDE$T IN THI$ BITCH.’ </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">It&#8217;s his third official project following 2024’s four-track collaborative EP with Mavo, ‘</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Kobilou Kilobizzy</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">,’ and the more recent ‘</span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pretty Girls Love Lou</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">.’ For Airbrid, it’s a first body of work that builds on his production credits on standout Mavo cuts like “</span><b>Shooting Star</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">” and “</span><b>Feel Nice</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.”</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Both Kilogbede Records signees have enjoyed a productive year. While Kobilou&#8217;s profile has risen through his solo releases and collaborations, it’s his standout verse on the viral </span><b>“GLACIER GIRL”</b><span style="font-weight: 400;"> earlier in the year that marked a breakthrough. Aibrid, meanwhile, has continued to work closely with Mavo, producing songs like “</span><b>Business</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">” and the recently released “</span><b>Goyard</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.”</span></p>
<p><iframe title="Kobilou X Aibrid - PA¥ M€ (Visualizer)" width="640" height="360" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Xx0NKYn-EnU?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">‘D’BADDE$T IN THI$ BITCH’  </span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">brings their respective strengths into sharper focus. First teased with the lead single “</span><b>PAY ME</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">” in July, the six-track project pairs Aibrid’s buoyant, mid-tempo production with Kobilou’s loose, melodic delivery. Guitar riffs, horn sections, and skittering percussion add texture to the beats, while Kobilou rides the instrumentals with his characteristically laid-back delivery and playful shifts in cadence.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">scottyolorin is the project’s sole guest, featuring on “</span><b>8 FIGURE$</b><span style="font-weight: 400;">.” He brings his distinctive melodic sensibility to a concise project that expands Kobilou and Aibrid’s repertoires and strengthens their positions within the country&#8217;s vibrant underground scene. </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Listen to </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">‘D’BADDE$T IN THI$ BITCH’ </span></i><a href="https://orcd.co/kobilou-aibrid?utm_source=ig&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_content=link_in_bio&amp;fbclid=PAZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgJzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA85MzY2MTk3NDMzOTI0NTkAAafDnM6Bu2QWj0fP6rUwhnKFxbtyw938Ef1K4AUJK8sYteO1jBNdjjhSboSxnQ_aem_IuA7s362t5BTdiaTETiACQ"><span style="font-weight: 400;">here</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">. </span></p>
<p>The post <a href="https://thenativemag.com/kobilou-and-airbrid-are-extending-their-winning-streak-with-dbaddet-in-thi-bitch/">Kobilou And Aibrid Are Extending Their Winning Streak With ‘D’BADDE$T IN THI$ BITCH</a> appeared first on <a href="https://thenativemag.com">The NATIVE</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
